WEBVTT

00:00:17.993 --> 00:00:20.553
[sniffing] Ah-choo!

00:00:32.273 --> 00:00:34.553
[laughing]

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:36.593
- Hey, yo, D.J.
- What up?

00:00:36.673 --> 00:00:39.713
- We got ourselves a nodder.
- [chuckling]

00:00:43.193 --> 00:00:46.193
[♪ Kenny G: Songbird]

00:00:46.673 --> 00:00:49.553
Pretty music. [snoring]

00:00:49.673 --> 00:00:53.073
Yo, Wingo! Lane change, man.

00:00:53.273 --> 00:00:55.633
- Right back at ya!
- Yeah!

00:00:55.713 --> 00:00:58.793
- Oops! I missed.
- You going on vacation?

00:00:58.873 --> 00:01:02.073
[all laugh]

00:01:02.113 --> 00:01:03.873
[snoring]

00:01:08.913 --> 00:01:11.273
[snoring]

00:01:15.953 --> 00:01:18.193
- [chuckling]
- [sniffling]

00:01:18.273 --> 00:01:21.553
- Oh, no, Snot Rod...
- He's gonna blow!

00:01:21.593 --> 00:01:24.433
Ah... Ah... Ah-choo!

00:01:24.593 --> 00:01:25.833
Gesundheit!

00:01:26.873 --> 00:01:29.993
One should never drive while drowsy.

00:01:30.113 --> 00:01:33.113
- [tires squealing]
- [horns honking]

00:01:37.873 --> 00:01:39.993
- [honking loudly]
- [screaming]

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:45.513
- Uh! Ah!
- [all honking]

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:50.953
[breathing heavily] Mack!

00:01:52.113 --> 00:01:54.593
- [grunting]
- [horns honking]

00:01:56.873 --> 00:01:58.233
Mack!

00:02:04.353 --> 00:02:05.433
Mack!

00:02:05.993 --> 00:02:08.313
Hey, Mack! Mack!

00:02:10.433 --> 00:02:11.993
Mack!

00:02:12.073 --> 00:02:14.633
Mack, wait for me! [engine revving]

00:02:17.993 --> 00:02:19.313
[tires squealing]

00:02:23.153 --> 00:02:24.433
Mack!

00:02:26.633 --> 00:02:29.113
[bell ringing]

00:02:36.433 --> 00:02:37.753
[horn bellowing]

00:02:44.993 --> 00:02:47.073
Mack! Mack!

00:02:49.793 --> 00:02:51.713
Mack! Mack...

00:02:51.793 --> 00:02:54.233
...wait up! [coughing] Mack.

00:02:55.473 --> 00:02:57.233
Mack! Mack!

00:02:57.313 --> 00:02:59.553
What? You're not Mack.

00:02:59.593 --> 00:03:04.353
Mack? I ain't no Mack!
I'm a Peterbilt, for dang sake!

00:03:04.713 --> 00:03:07.393
[Peterbilt]
Turn on your lights, you moron!

00:03:11.873 --> 00:03:14.473
Mack... The Interstate!

00:03:15.593 --> 00:03:18.393
[tires squealing]

00:03:25.553 --> 00:03:29.033
- [engine roaring]
- Huh?

00:03:29.073 --> 00:03:31.953
Not in my town, you don't.

00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:35.033
[siren wailing]

00:03:36.273 --> 00:03:38.073
Oh, no.

00:03:38.153 --> 00:03:40.713
- Oh, maybe he can help me!
- [Sheriff backfiring]

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.033
He's shooting at me!
Why is he shooting at me?

00:03:43.073 --> 00:03:44.113
[backfiring]

00:03:44.193 --> 00:03:46.473
I haven't gone this fast in years.

00:03:46.553 --> 00:03:49.393
[grunting] I'm gonna
blow a gasket or somethin'.

00:03:49.433 --> 00:03:51.753
Serpentine! Serpentine, serpentine!

00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:53.553
What in the blue blazes?

00:03:53.593 --> 00:03:55.153
Crazy hot-rodder.

00:03:57.073 --> 00:03:58.753
[siren continues wailing]

00:03:58.873 --> 00:04:01.593
[♪ Hank Williams:
My Heart Would Know]

00:04:08.913 --> 00:04:11.313
[buzzing]

00:04:32.193 --> 00:04:34.073
[water hose turning on]

00:04:41.353 --> 00:04:44.993
[snoring]

00:04:56.153 --> 00:05:00.753
I'm telling you, man,
every third blink is slower.

00:05:05.233 --> 00:05:07.913
The sixties weren't good to you,
were they?

00:05:07.993 --> 00:05:09.713
[car backfires]

00:05:13.473 --> 00:05:14.993
[sirens blasting]

00:05:17.353 --> 00:05:20.513
What? That's not the Interstate!

00:05:20.593 --> 00:05:22.473
- [Sheriff backfires]
- Ah! Oh!

00:05:22.513 --> 00:05:25.833
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:29.113
- [screaming]
- [tires screeching]

00:05:29.953 --> 00:05:31.273
No, no, no, no, no, no!

00:05:32.673 --> 00:05:33.793
Ow!

00:05:35.993 --> 00:05:39.033
I'm not the only one seeing this, right?

00:05:39.433 --> 00:05:41.153
- Incoming!
- Whoa, man.

00:05:41.193 --> 00:05:42.513
- No!
- Hey!

00:05:43.553 --> 00:05:44.873
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:05:45.873 --> 00:05:47.113
My tires!

00:05:48.113 --> 00:05:49.993
- [grunting]
- [gasping]

00:05:52.713 --> 00:05:55.593
- [screaming]
- [gasping]

00:05:58.713 --> 00:06:00.913
- [tires squealing]
- [cables vibrating]

00:06:06.393 --> 00:06:07.953
[yelling]

00:06:12.553 --> 00:06:14.913
[shouting]

00:06:15.073 --> 00:06:16.073
[screaming]

00:06:21.713 --> 00:06:25.793
- [cables whizzing]
- [straining]

